      "sound_on_label": "🔊 Sound on",
      "sound_toggle_hint": "Silences the engine rumble, radio chatter, suit breathing and every alert tone.",
      "task_0": "Pick a difficulty, look over the mission profile, then press Begin Mission.",
      "task_1": "Watch the Saturn V climb. When the banner turns green you are in orbit — press Proceed to Orbit.",
      "task_10": "Read your flight record — four graded calls — then fly again and beat it.",
      "task_2": "Timing call: wait for the green burn window, then fire TLI. Firing early is allowed, but it costs a correction later.",
      "task_3": "Answer the knowledge check, decide on the mid-course correction if one is offered, then head for lunar orbit.",
      "task_4": "Watch one orbit: loss of signal behind the Moon, Earthrise, then undock for the descent.",
      "task_5": "Fly the landing: W or ↑ for thrust, A/D to slide. Touch down under 3 m/s down and 5 m/s sideways.",
