      "journal_behavior_v": "Double-scratching in leaf litter, tail pumped",
      "journal_date": "Date",
      "journal_date_v": "14 May, 7:20 am",
      "journal_note": "The species line ends in a question mark on purpose — an honest \"sparrow?\" plus what you actually saw is worth more than a confident wrong name.",
