      "dark_cloud_or_pseudomorph_blob_ejected": "Dark cloud or \"pseudomorph\" blob ejected through siphon.",
      "dartfish_hover_above_sand_burrows_they": "Dartfish hover above sand burrows; they dive into the burrow at the slightest threat. Octopuses hunting them must close the gap stealthily before the dive-into-burrow reflex triggers.",
