      "landa_later_wrote_his_own_ethnographic": "Landa later wrote his own ethnographic account (\"Relación de las cosas de Yucatán\", 1566), which became the main scholarly source for early Maya studies — meaning a primary record of Maya civilization comes filtered through the man who destroyed its books.",
