      "why_so_many": "Why so many?",
      "why_some_compartments_were_bigger_lett": "📊 Why some compartments were bigger (letter frequency)",
      "why_this_works_when_you_fold_the_sheet": "Why this works: when you fold the sheet in half, the outer-right page (1) lands on top of the outer-left page (4). Page 1 is the cover; page 4 is the back. Opening the folded sheet reveals the inner side, with page 2 facing page 3. Read the book — 1, 2, 3, 4.",
      "why_your_laptop_has_uppercase_and_lowe": "Why your laptop has uppercase and lowercase. Where leading and em-dash come from. The vocabulary of digital type is the vocabulary of a 1450 print shop.",
      "width_references_come_from_physical_ty": "Width references come from physical type sizes used as rulers in print shops.",
